# The Challenge 3 deliverable is an audio file, so it has to be an exception
# to the rules above. Scoped to SUBMISSION/ so working audio stays untracked.
!SUBMISSION/*.mp3
!SUBMISSION/*.wav
!SUBMISSION/*.txt

# Word's lock files, created whenever a .docx is open. Never worth committing.
~$*
